        "description": "Requires user:manage with live target hierarchy; bots superadmin. Users without currentrank OR missingrequired training. SQL filters beforepagination. Completion qualified or finished only when noORBATqualification; empty requiredset complete. Attendance counts presentmainops+legacy. MinimalDTO without email; returnedotheruserread audit only, no snapshots.",
